									</tr>
									<tr style="height: 62px; background-color: #ffffff; vertical-align: top;">
										<td style="width: 299px; height: 62px;  font-size:.8em;">Scale measures the ratio of the distance on <br /> the map or chart compared to the real world distance. <br /> The greater the scale, a larger area and less detail <br /> will be represented in the map or chart.</td>
									</tr>
								</tbody>
							</table>
						</div>
						<select id="chartScale" style="float: left; margin-left: 3px; max-width:100px">
